{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_127_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_127","textTraditional":"一、十有三年，春，齊師伐衞。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_127_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_127","textTraditional":"二、夏，楚子伐宋。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_127_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_127","textTraditional":"三、秋，〈虫衆〉。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_127_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_127","textTraditional":"四、冬，晉殺其大夫先縠。","sentenceOrder":4}],"overrides":{}}